    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-1-3",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod1-Q3",
        "itemBody": "<p>An analyst observes the following annual rates of return for a hedge fund: Year Return (%) Year 1 22.0 Year 2 −25.0 Year 3 11.0 The hedge fund’s annual geometric mean return is closest to:</p>",
