      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod1-Q18",
        "itemBody": "<p>A portfolio provides the following returns over a five-year period. Year 1 2 3 4 5 Return 10% –25% 8% 5% 7% The average compound rate of return of the portfolio across the five-year period is closest to:</p>",
